    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosavane Borers LLC is a mining exploration simulator that puts you in the driver\u2019s helmet of your very own customizable miner. Dig tunnels, discover precious gems and ores, then sell your haul to upgrade equipment and reach greater depths\u2014all rendered in charming hand\u2011drawn pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Miner</strong> <br>Personalize your character\u2019s appearance\u2014choose hairstyle, outfit and more to create the miner that\u2019s uniquely you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand\u2011Drawn Pixel Art</strong> <br>Every rock, crystal and cavern wall is lovingly crafted in hand\u2011drawn pixel style, creating a vibrant and immersive mining world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Upgrades &amp; Progression</strong> <br>Earn coins by selling your findings, then invest in better pickaxes and other special tools to dig deeper and faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> <br>Balance your cargo holds\u2014decide which gems to keep and which to trade for maximum profit and performance boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your mining adventure with Rosavane Borers LLC today\u2014dig, discover, and dominate the depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>\u3010Characters\u3011</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844580/extras/dde939e837e5038343ec3560faf04c04.avif?t=1755790609\" width=500 height=816 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosavane Borers LLC is a mining exploration simulator that puts you in the driver\u2019s helmet of your very own customizable miner. Dig tunnels, discover precious gems and ores, then sell your haul to upgrade equipment and reach greater depths\u2014all rendered in charming hand\u2011drawn pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Miner</strong> <br>Personalize your character\u2019s appearance\u2014choose hairstyle, outfit and more to create the miner that\u2019s uniquely you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand\u2011Drawn Pixel Art</strong> <br>Every rock, crystal and cavern wall is lovingly crafted in hand\u2011drawn pixel style, creating a vibrant and immersive mining world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Upgrades &amp; Progression</strong> <br>Earn coins by selling your findings, then invest in better pickaxes and other special tools to dig deeper and faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> <br>Balance your cargo holds\u2014decide which gems to keep and which to trade for maximum profit and performance boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your mining adventure with Rosavane Borers LLC today\u2014dig, discover, and dominate the depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>\u3010Characters\u3011</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844580/extras/dde939e837e5038343ec3560faf04c04.avif?t=1755790609\" width=500 height=816 /></span></p>",
